{
  "id": "E353",
  "title": "Broken Coffee Machine",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-08-18",
  "synopsis": "The coffee machine is broken again. What will Little Zhang do about it?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1126/bf487f0287e7c5d3e42add69da6e5814468cbb2a.mp3?1565531231",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "咖啡机坏了\n\n小张：小何，咖啡机好像坏了，你快来帮我看看。\n小何：我看看，你把它关掉，再打开试试。\n小张：还是不行。\n小何：我也不知道怎么修咖啡机，你打电话给后勤部，他们会找人来修的。\n小张：好吧，看来今天喝不了咖啡了。\n小何：没办法。这个咖啡机太老了。\n小张：公司什么时候才能买新咖啡机啊！",
    "traditional": "咖啡機壞了\n\n小張：小何，咖啡機好像壞了，你快來幫我看看。\n小何：我看看，你把它關掉，再打開試試。\n小張：還是不行。\n小何：我也不知道怎麼修咖啡機，你打電話給後勤部，他們會找人來修的。\n小張：好吧，看來今天喝不了咖啡了。\n小何：沒辦法。這個咖啡機太老了。\n小張：公司什麼時候才能買新咖啡機啊！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Coffee Machine is Broken"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：小何，咖啡机好像坏了，你快来帮我看看。",
      "traditional": "小張：小何，咖啡機好像壞了，你快來幫我看看。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng xiǎo hé kā fēi jī hǎo xiàng huài le nǐ kuài lái bāng wǒ kàn kan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Little He, it seems like the coffee machine is broken. Hurry up and help me have a look."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：我看看，你把它关掉，再打开试试。",
      "traditional": "小何：我看看，你把它關掉，再打開試試。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ kàn kan nǐ bǎ tā guān diào zài dǎ kāi shì shi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Let me see. Try to turn off the machine and then turn it on."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：还是不行。",
      "traditional": "小張：還是不行。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hái shì bù xíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: It still doesn’t work."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：我也不知道怎么修咖啡机，你打电话给后勤部，他们会找人来修的。",
      "traditional": "小何：我也不知道怎麼修咖啡機，你打電話給後勤部，他們會找人來修的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ yě bù zhī dào zěn me xiū kā fēi jī nǐ dǎ diàn huà gěi hòu qín bù tā men huì zhǎo rén lái xiū de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I don't know how to fix it either. You can call the logistics department, they will find someone to fix it."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：好吧，看来今天喝不了咖啡了。",
      "traditional": "小張：好吧，看來今天喝不了咖啡了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo ba kàn lái jīn tiān hē bù liǎo kā fēi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Fine. It seems like we won’t be able to drink any coffee today."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小何：没办法。这个咖啡机太老了。",
      "traditional": "小何：沒辦法。這個咖啡機太老了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé méi bàn fǎ zhè ge kā fēi jī tài lǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: There’s nothing we can do about it. This coffee machine is too old."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小张：公司什么时候才能买新咖啡机啊！",
      "traditional": "小張：公司什麼時候才能買新咖啡機啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng gōng sī shén me shí hou cái néng mǎi xīn kā fēi jī a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: When will the company buy a new coffee machine!"
    }
  ],
